# Copy to `.env.production` (gitignored) or set in Render **Build** environment variables.
# Vite loads from `web_dashboard/`; repo-root VITE_* (e.g. VITE_DEV_TIER) is merged in vite.config.ts.
# Do NOT set VITE_DEV_TIER in production builds.

# Public API origin — no trailing `/api` required; `src/modules/api.ts` normalizes it.
# Same-origin (dashboard + API on one host): omit VITE_API_BASE_URL; the client uses `window.location.origin + '/api'`.
# Split hosts (static site vs API host):
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.veltrixia.net
# LP (index.html): set <meta name="veltrixia-api-base" content="https://YOUR-API.onrender.com">
#   (no trailing /api). lp-live.js probes /api/status and caches a working origin.
# Split static dashboard + API host (preferred: meta tag in app.html):
#   <meta name="veltrixia-api-base" content="https://osint-platform.onrender.com">
# Or set absolute API origin at build time (optional if meta is present):
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://osint-platform.onrender.com
